    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo indie developer, everything lies in your hands: Adding features, editing the levels and trying to make the best game you can. Each attempt is different and gives you the chance to build the next big indie hit. Choose the perfect music, add better art and manage the expectations of your parents. The reviews will judge you in any case. It's all about <i>The Games You Make</i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/2742987cb5d0d03945c2188b582f53b4.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/2742987cb5d0d03945c2188b582f53b4.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/2742987cb5d0d03945c2188b582f53b4.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make good choices </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jetpacks or jump scares? Why not both! Choose between spending time on combining new exciting features, much needed fixes or tending to your social life. Every choice you make will be reflected in the resulting game. Turn that weird bug into a feature or work on the perfect beginning of the level. Follow up with that artist from last week\u2019s meetup to get more visual oomph.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success and failure will determine the next set of features to unlock which in turn might give you the edge you\u2019ve been looking for in the next title. Survive long enough on your budget to see yourself succeed as brilliant indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/e6b1470bce0a46563e23bea33f0a3b65.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/e6b1470bce0a46563e23bea33f0a3b65.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/e6b1470bce0a46563e23bea33f0a3b65.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make a game, for real</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level editor provides you with all the tools to create a game, and it's up to you to design the best version possible. Ensure it remains playable; the reviews will let you know what they think about your efforts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/b82881a19e493eea2e0365154cb6c2c4.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/b82881a19e493eea2e0365154cb6c2c4.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/b82881a19e493eea2e0365154cb6c2c4.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make friends </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you are working on your game, life happens around you. Whoever you choose to spend time with might open the door to funding, new features or just mental support. Take care of yourself and your friends. Your curiosity might be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's yours to make or break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose to make your level a cozy wholesome trip through the fields or a bomb-spiked tower of destruction. You are limited by time, imagination and your budget.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Features, Bugs and Modes to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive Level-Editor: Share your levels with other players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative Freedom: Combine Features in surprising ways and build unique gameplay twists  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contextual Narration: Friends and family accompany you on your journey. Will they support you or drive you mad?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
