.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/ead201a2c030175f059203425554307c.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's yours to make or break</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose to make your level a cozy wholesome trip through the fields or a bomb-spiked tower of destruction. You are limited by time, imagination and your budget.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/c1ee52515ab30ae1c7e7b735d6b2d134.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Features, Bugs and Modes to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive Level-Editor: Share your levels with other players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative Freedom: Combine Features in surprising ways and build unique gameplay twists  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contextual Narration: Friends and family accompany you on your journey. Will they support you or drive you mad?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.poster.avif?t=1753439767\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.webm?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852750/extras/d55f436d30e84d6daff475f21f35390e.mp4?t=1753439767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cQuit your job, take out a loan and make a top seller game\u201d sounded like a great idea two months ago. Now, you\u2019re chasing bizarre bugs, combining features that should never go together, and striving to capture that mysterious thing called \u201cfun\u201d. Every decision is yours\u2014and so are the consequences.",
